<p>nargha hai dilbar-e- hassan-e- sabz posh par<br />
chaaro'n taraf hai teero'n ki bouchaar josh par<br />
dil par sinaa'n ka zaqm hai pahlu pa dosh par<br />
sehre ki sab kati huwi ladiyaa'n hai dosh par</p>

<p>talwar ran me dulhe ka mu qoo'n se dhoti hai<br />
qaime me ghul hai aaj dulhan beva hoti hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>beh beh ke qoo'n tapakta hai har baar haath se<br />
zaqmi hai nikli jaati hai talwaar haath se<br />
ab kya kare nabard hai paikaar haath se<br />
chooti enaan-e aspe wafaadar haath se</p>

<p>qoo'n bahgaya jahaa'n se mu modhne lage<br />
gir kar zameen-e- garm pa dam todhne lage<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sar kaatne udhar se badhe fouj ke sawaar<br />
doudhe idhar se shaah alam karke zulfeqaar<br />
the saath saath akbar-o- abbas-e- naamdaar<br />
dehshat se teen shero'n ki bhaage sitam sheyaar</p>

<p>majrooh natawaa'n ka ajab haal hogaya<br />
ghodo'n se jism dulha ka paamal hogaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rone lage imaam-e- umam dekh kar ye haal<br />
laasha uthaa ke le chale aaqir basad malaal<br />
ek do qadam badha tha rasool-e- quda ka laal<br />
hichki jo aayi margaya hai hai wo qushqisaal</p>

<p>godi me sheh ki phool se kumlaa ke rahgaye<br />
baazu lahu bhare huwe tharra ke rahgaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>fizza ne dekha sheh ko jo aate huwe idhar<br />
qaime ke sahan se ye pukari ba-chashme tar<br />
saidanio'n uroos se hushiyaar-o- ba qabar<br />
deodhi tak aayi maadar-e- noushaah nouhagar</p>

<p>faaqo'n se hai nidhaal qadam ladkhadaate hai<br />
masnad bichaao dulha ko shabbir laate hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haalat hai gham se ghair shah-e- qushqisaal ki<br />
hai hai jawaani qasim-e- yousuf jamaal ki<br />
poshaak qoo'n se surq hai is nou nehaal ki<br />
aao baraat dekhlo shabbar ke laal ki</p>

<p>rone ka shor charq pa jaata hai saahibo<br />
dulha chacha ki god me aata hai saahibo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>doudhe haram idhar se khule sar barahna paa<br />
qaime me aaye laash liye shaah-e- dosaraa<br />
naamoos me qiyaamate kubra huwi bapaa<br />
waa qaasima ki charq pa jaane lagi sadaa</p>

<p>bahne'n qareeb aagayi aansu bahane ko<br />
phailaaye maa ne haath gale se lagaane ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qaime tak aaye sab haram-e- paak nouha gar<br />
laasha litake rone lage shaah-e- behrobar<br />
abbas peetne lage haatho'n se apna sar<br />
akbar ka paas rakh diya sehra lahu me tar</p>

<p>taazeer haal maadar-e- ghamnaak hogaya<br />
seene ke zaqm dekh ke dil chaak hogaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>fizza ne baandha hujre ka parda basad malaal<br />
laaye dulhan ko thaam ke bano-e- qushqisaal<br />
mitti bhari thi maang me kubra ka tha ye haal<br />
mai-li si chaadar odhe huwe khole sar ke baal</p>

<p>dikhla ke zaqm sab jasad-e- paash paash ke<br />
bithla diya uroos ko pahlu me laash ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>jis dam dulhan ne dulha ke zaqmo'n pa ki nazar<br />
kaampa kaleja ashk bahe shaq huwa jigar<br />
qadmo'n ki simt jhuk ke ye boli wo nouhagar<br />
saaheb utho ham aaye hai laashe pa nange sar</p>

<p>khole hai baal bekas-o- naalaa'n ko dekhlo<br />
tum bhi hamare haal-e- pareshaa'n ko dekhlo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>saaheb bataao kya mai aseer-e- mehan kahoo'n<br />
bekas kahoo'n, ghareeb kahoo'n, bewatan kahoo'n,<br />
majroo kahoo'n mai aap ko ya bekafan kahoo'n<br />
dulha kahoo'n ke aapko ibn-e- hassan kahoo'n</p>

<p>kya kehke ro-u koi batataa nahi'n mujhe<br />
tazaa dulhan hoo'n bain bhi aata nahi mujhe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>fizza ne laake itne me randsaala rakhdiya<br />
dulha ki maa ne haath me usko uthaa liya<br />
aur boli isko pahno ye qillat hai beva ka<br />
kubra ne sar ko peet ke aur roke ye kaha</p>

<p>ab kyu'n libaas bevon ka mujh ko pinhaate hai<br />
dulhan banake kya koi bevaa banaate hai<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>